    ["集齐15个可以获得秘偶巴尼先生，也可用于秘偶巴尼先生的培养。"] = "Collect 15 to obtain the marionette Mr. Barney; they can also be used to upgrade the marionette Mr. Barney.",
    ["集齐15个可以获得秘偶异化猎犬，也可用于秘偶异化猎犬的培养。"] = "Collect 15 to obtain the marionette Alienated Hound; they can also be used to upgrade the marionette Alienated Hound.",
    ["集齐15个可以获得秘偶异化赛琳娜，也可用于秘偶异化赛琳娜的培养。"] = "Collect 15 to obtain the marionette Alienated Selena; they can also be used to upgrade the marionette Alienated Selena.",
